I'm just, these are rough estimates, but you
get what I'm saying. It's along those orders

00:47:27.230 --> 00:47:34.000
of magnitude. So Bitcoin had to figure out
a solution that would scale, help it scale

00:47:34.000 --> 00:47:37.410
that infrastructure so that more payments
